1.Product type code format PT001 OK
2.Purchase code format PO2025-034 OK
3.Sales code format SO2025-034 OK
3.In one purchase order you can not have similar product types
4.Subtotal -> Total Tax Exclusive
5.Total -> Total Tax Inclusive

PURCHASE ORDER
--------------

STATUS: CREATED,SUBMITTED,APPROVED,RETURNED

USERS: ADMIN, MANAGER, SALES_OFFICER, STOCK_OFFICER

Edit and delete is possible only when order is created or returned by officers


PurchaseOrderHistory
{
  purchaseOrderId: reference to purchase order
  creationDate: LocalDateTime
  state: PurchaseOrderState[CREATED, RETURNED, SUBMITTED, APPROVED]
  user_id: username of who did the action
  comments: String

}

PurchaseOrder{
  state: PurchaseOrderState[CREATED, RETURNED, SUBMITTED, APPROVED]

}

